|desc=
Fungal spores have colonized your blood, so that each time you use an infusion you store fungal power equal to twice your Constitution plus {{csl|Con|5%|0.5|1%}} of your maximum life.

You may use this prodigy to release the power as a heal (never more than {{csl|Con|50%|10|25%}} of max life) and remove up to 10 detrimental magical effects.

Fungal power lasts for up to 6 turns, losing the greater of 10 potency or 10% of its power each turn.

The amount of fungal power produced and the maximum heal possible increase with your Constitution and maximum life.
}}
===Notes===
*Stored fungal power has no maximum. Power from several infusions adds together, and each new infusion use resets the 6-turn duration.